then `const flow = ...; (flow[key]||noop)(); }` — and previously saveGame(true) was called BEFORE flow. I'll restructure to save AFTER the flow call; for deepking the flow kicks-off dialog — the chapter transition happens when the user picks a choice. To make the post-boss-save ALSO valid there, in DLG.mav add ensure ch4+quest; and in ch3_after pick add saveGame(true) after chSet. Also ch3_after default branch: `{ do: () => { Game.chSet(4); addQuest('ch4'); } }` — add saveGame(true) to that do as well.

